      "message": "Please review new patchset if it is fine. Thank you.\n\nNeed to handle no payload case and avoid additional mss option which is unexpected by test.\n  \na) three-way handshake packets may have no payload.\nb) TetherController::setupIptablesHooks limits downstream mss (ipv4 only) via iptables. It causes additional tcp option mss in syn/syn-ack packets\nc) additional mss option is misunderstood as payload because tcpheader class can\u0027t recognize tcp options.\n\nTetherController adds iptables TCPMSS to limits downstream mss.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/netd/server/TetherController.cpp;l\u003d507\n```\n    std::string mssRewriteCommand \u003d StringPrintf(\n        \"*mangle\\n\"\n        \"-A %s -p tcp --tcp-flags SYN SYN -j TCPMSS --clamp-mss-to-pmtu\\n\"\n        \"COMMIT\\n\", LOCAL_MANGLE_FORWARD);\n```\n\ntethered upload packets has additional TCP option MSS 536 which is not expected by test\n```\n130\t2022-09-16 15:09:30.318877\t192.168.55.21\t8.8.8.8\tTCP\t60\t9876 → 433 [SYN] Seq\u003d0 Win\u003d8192 Len\u003d0\n131\t2022-09-16 15:09:30.319047\t10.0.0.1\t8.8.8.8\tTCP\t64\t9876 → 433 [SYN] Seq\u003d0 Win\u003d8192 Len\u003d0 MSS\u003d536\n```\n\ntethered download packets has additional TCP option MSS 536 which is not expected by test\n```\n132\t2022-09-16 15:09:30.320842\t8.8.8.8\t10.0.0.1\tTCP\t60\t433 → 9876 [SYN, ACK] Seq\u003d0 Ack\u003d1 Win\u003d8192 Len\u003d0\n133\t2022-09-16 15:09:30.321026\t8.8.8.8\t192.168.55.21\tTCP\t64\t433 → 9876 [SYN, ACK] Seq\u003d0 Ack\u003d1 Win\u003d8192 Len\u003d0 MSS\u003d536\n```\n\nRemove \"TCPMSS --clamp-mss-to-pmtu\" from TetherController.\n\ntethered upload packets does not have tcp options\n```\n104\t2022-09-17 14:36:26.336137\t192.168.130.21\t8.8.8.8\tTCP\t60\t\t0x6a0d (27149)\t9876 → 433 [SYN] Seq\u003d0 Win\u003d8192 Len\u003d0\n105\t2022-09-17 14:36:26.336265\t10.0.0.1\t8.8.8.8\tTCP\t60\t\t0x6a0d (27149)\t9876 → 433 [SYN] Seq\u003d0 Win\u003d8192 Len\u